        "new": "\u2026ously.[28] This inequality generalizes to arbitrary pairs of self-adjoint operators \ud835\udc34 and \ud835\udc35 . The commutator of these two operators is [ \ud835\udc34 , \ud835\udc35 ] = \ud835\udc34 \ud835\udc35 \u2212 \ud835\udc35 \ud835\udc34 , and this provides the lower bound on the product of standard deviations: \ud835\udf0e \ud835\udc34 \ud835\udf0e \u2026"
